sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Diagnosis
  participant P as RemediationService
  participant S as Sandbox
  participant H as Human Admin
  participant X as Named write executor
  D->>P: create immutable plan/fingerprint
  P->>S: validate exact plan/target
  S-->>P: Before/After Evidence + verification
  P->>H: request exact approval
  H-->>P: approve or reject
  P->>X: execute registered action
  X-->>P: execution result
  P->>P: verify or registered rollback
